  <item>
    <title>24. 美丽岛大饭店Ⅰ：散落在台湾的异乡人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b40cb5b810e066f9c78d3e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b40cb5b810e066f9c78d3e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 13:21:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>去年下半年，马特前往台大交换，在当地经历了许多与外省族群、身份认同相关的小故事。我们一直对这类议题抱有浓厚兴趣，因此以他的亲身见闻为灵感，制作了这期节目，和大家一同聊聊散落在台湾各地的外省印记，以及那些藏在时光里的迁徙与人生。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>🏷️时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> 台湾影视作品里的外省痕迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">07:01</a> 眷村与永和大王</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> 探秘竹联帮发祥地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a> 没有韩式料理和K-Pop的韩国街</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 怎么宵夜还吃豆浆油条包子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 二代三代移民的走样河南口音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a> 在缅甸街吃云南伊斯兰餐厅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 从双和到旗津：大陈新村与蒋公庙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 101塔下的眷村：四四南村</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2168">36:08</a> 21世纪还有察哈尔省认同？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2459">40:59</a> 不一样的生活，玩同样的梗</span></p><span></span><h2><span>🎙️本期主播</span></h2><span></span><p><span>西撒</span></p><span></span><p><span>马特</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏞️</span></p><span></span><p><span>高雄旗津 大陈新村蒋公感恩堂</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoiCrZ0-lZJDwywkr9Wuu4FSf18p.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>台北大安 蒙藏文化馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftgs1GPEkk2xZn60sP6kePYa07q9.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>新北永和 眷村巷弄</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkr4dskF3JqtmculiBrWSXUDzCr4.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢我们的节目，请多多点赞收藏分享 :D</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有想对我们说的话和想提出的建议，也可以在评论区留言，我们会认真阅读每一条评论~</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时，在这里祝各位听友马年大吉，天天开心！</span></p>]]></description>
