  <item>
    <title>22. 我在德国炸洋芋：慕尼黑留学打工小记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68826616a9dec9250005bcc6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68826616a9dec9250005bcc6</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“你现在不好好学习，二天怕不是只能推个车车去gai边边买炸洋芋哦”</span></p><span></span><p><span>——这句父母师长的“至理名言”，是身为贵州人的西撒和马特在学生时代耳熟能详的“金句”。时光荏苒，马特居然真的靠炸洋芋赚起了钱。只不过，bro现在跑到了遥远的慕尼黑不让街区的孩子饿肚子🔥🥷💎。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><h2><span>🏷️时间轴</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 真正懂事的贵州娃儿已经开始在外地做洋芋主理人了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> 电影都敢这么演，熟客变店员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a> 网红餐厅内部势力划分，干过的才知道门道有多深</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a> 没办法，他们实在给得太多了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 欧洲怎么也搞起小费“恶习”了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 慕尼黑主理人餐厅招牌菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 炸洋芋SOP大公开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a> 哭死，居然还有地方招暑假工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> 德国文科生就业如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> 找办公室实习碰壁实录</span></p><span></span><h2><span>🎙️本期主播</span></h2><span></span><p><span>西撒</span></p><span></span><p><span>马特</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏞️</span></p><span></span><p><span>Matt's Workshop</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmz5FELzw8BarmYWGI279C1pFFAw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>马特供职的餐厅，欢迎线下捕捉📍慕尼黑（如果在上海：超绝露营原木风氛围感bistro:)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsJCKfO9be5UnDNSIRtuw4ly4Zx8.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>欧洲杯女足半决赛投影，这场德国失利了</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjiPBczVU449VzmywxSSIhDr94xW.JPG"></figure><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>P.S.</span></h2><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢我们的节目，请多多点赞收藏分享 :D</span></p><span></span><p><span>想加入听友群，可以添加卫星：fm-y2k</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目更多消息，请关注小红薯：Y2K歪吐快</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有想对我们说的话和想提出的建议，也可以在评论区留言，我们会认真阅读每一条评论~</span></p><span></span><p><span>相关节目：</span></p><span></span><p><span>19. 文化2025: 一个文科留德华的“异质生活”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67e17c2378103db3bda546b8" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67e17c2378103db3bda546b8">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
