    <title>18. 德国大选前瞻——谁将问鼎中原？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b2174805a90dfd0dde236c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b2174805a90dfd0dde236c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Feb 2025 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽，好久不见！本期我们来盘一盘德国大选~</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏷️时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 德国大选到底是选啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 参选的四大主要政党</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">04:41</a> 稳操胜券基民盟？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">9:43</a> 喜闻乐见的老朋友爱丽丝·魏德尔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 经济搞不起来的朔尔茨还能挽救社民党吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1357">22:37</a> 环保左翼的式微与顽强——绿党</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1637">27:17</a> 边角料：从着装风格看各位领导人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">30:32</a> 传统左翼的消亡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1969">32:49</a> 大选日程安排</span></p><span></span><h2><span>🎙️本期主播</span></h2><span></span><p><span>西撒</span></p><span></span><p><span>马特</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏞️相关图片</span></p><span></span><p><span>现任德国总理奥拉夫·朔尔茨（社民党）的竞选海报，“为你做更多，让德国更好”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llQfBdUa8P9U_cIb6ZoqVIPISh1Y.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>基督教民主联盟（CDU）巴伐利亚分支基督教社会联盟（CSU）的竞选海报：“让秩序重归德国”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtQADN11ASrxp88HZUxPSh1fdBtw.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>现任联邦副总理、经济部长、环保部长罗伯特·哈贝克（绿党）的竞选海报：“信念——一个人，一个词”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpaMvmzi_DnzX98DDl77MvHjE0VF.JPG"></figure><span></span><h2><span>P.S.</span></h2><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢我们的节目，请多多点赞收藏分享 :D</span></p><span></span><p><span>想加入听友群，可以添加卫星：fm-y2k</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目更多消息，请关注小红薯：Y2K歪吐快</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有想对我们说的话和想提出的建议，也可以在评论区留言，我们会认真阅读每一条评论~</span></p>]]></description>
